/29/9776889/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな事を思い出したな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちアイドルになってよかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきも書いたけど本当に皆さんが大好きです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず!!\nみなさんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもっ\n乃木坂４６はまだまだまだまだまだ...上り坂!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目標に近づくために...\n乃木坂４６がもっと沢山の方々に知ってもらえるように..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのでみなさんこれからも末永くよろしくお願いいたします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言いたいことが沢山ありすぎてどう表現すればよいのがわからないっ〓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも本当に感謝しています!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(・∀・)ノ\nへばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-11865":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわあわあ ☆//\nろってぃ−でぇーす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/05/06/6827692/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル公演に来ると\n実物の大きさのメンバーと\n一緒にお写真が撮れるんだねぇ〜\n(*´∨`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーはそれを今日知って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろも 帰る前に\nさゆにゃん♪に並んで\n撮ってきました )))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう? いい感じかな(^^)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ−でーす ☆笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/05/06/6827692/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日☆! !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部では女中3に選んで頂き\n2部では 沢村小坊主役に\n選んで頂きました !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に嬉しかったです !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票してくださった皆さん\n今日来てくださった皆さん\n応援してくださった皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も本当に\nありがとうございましたあっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢村は元気な少年 !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に作りこまない\n素の自分のまま話し方でできて\nとってもテモテモ\n楽しかったです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言いつつ本当は\nセリフとか全部 本番始まるまで\n必死に台本燃える位\n見てたからね(/*´ω`*)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし!\n明日も頑張ります !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうね(〃∨〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと色々書きたいんだけど...\nまた明日ねん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん大好き!\nおやすみなさい(/〃∨〃)/"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-22403":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばんは！\n \n けやき坂46の加藤史帆です！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZMC5SB97D4D5NCSXKXH0R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n 今日はポートメッセなごやで全国握手会でした！\n \n ペアは石森さんと2人だったんですが、途中から京子(齊藤京子)と３人になりました！\n \n 石森さんも石森さんのファンの皆さんも優しくて嬉しかったです！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZMD991F46AEYBC748ZBDD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZMEAE34YNRVGTME6GB3Y1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n うどん！！美味でした(・ω・)！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZMFGP5P9RG0A6V6ET732H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n 久しぶりに大好きなサーティーワンのストロベリーチーズケーキを食べました！\n 美味しすぎたああo(^o^)o\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZMGJG4BH9XP6XPVGFDA9R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n 人生初の手羽先も食べました！\n \n 美味しすぎてびっくりしました！綺麗な食べ方もマスターしたので、また食べたいたいです！\n \n ひつまぶしも食べてみたい！名古屋の食べ物をもっと食べてみたいなって思いました！\n \n ばいばい☆\n \n 加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-15104":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n2期生最年長まいちゅんこと\n新内眞衣ですo(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東は今日から\n一気に寒くなってきて、\n今朝、早速冬仕様のコートを\n引っ張り出しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いたら11月も1/3が終了。\nそりゃ寒いはずですよね（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒がりだけど冬は好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうそう！\n前回書いたハロウィンの話、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生はすっかり忘れてて\nお菓子貰えませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてた分\n本当に衝撃的でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生には\n食べ物の怨みは怖いですよ。\nと煽っておいたので笑\n今年中にチョコレートをくれる\n事でしょう(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聖母さま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいさんブログを\n愛読している方は\nご存知と思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、遂にまいまいさんと\nプライベートで\n遊ばせて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い返せば、\n初めて誘ったのは7月、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に来てくれる方や\nブログにコメントしてくれる方に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか誘ってみなよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われたのをきっかけに\n勇気を振り絞って誘ってみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん快くOKを\nしてくれたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイミングや予定が\nなかなか合わなく、、、\n今回やっと行くことが\n出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいさんにも\n催促してくれてた皆さん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェに行ったのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったりまったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩みを聞いて貰ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいさんの携帯に\n入ってる秘蔵動画を見たり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3時間があっという間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しかったし、\n背中を押して貰えました（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー癒されたなー(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はご馳走して頂いたので、\n今度は私に任せて下さい(｀_´)ゞ\nまたご飯行きましょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは、、、\n今日は早いですが、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お返事TIME"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、\n嬉しい事に美容関係の事を\n質問されるようになったので\n今回は美容編です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あんまり興味ない人がいたら\nごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では早速、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂上がりに\n必ずする事はなんですかー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"化粧水などで肌を整える\n↓\n全身にボディークリームを塗る\n↓\nパジャマを着る\n↓\n簡単なストレッチ\n↓\n髪の毛を乾かす\n↓\n温かい飲み物を飲む"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの流れはこんな感じです！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通の女の子のお風呂上がりと\nあまり変わらないと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これにプラスして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"疲れた時には、\nマッサージをしたり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プニプニしてきたなと思った時には\n腹筋20回をしたり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会前は、\nスペシャルパックをしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご参考までに(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体型維持はどうしてますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは永遠の課題ですよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、食べる事が大好きで\n本当よく食べるので、\n油断してると\nすぐお肉がつきます(°_°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり\n自分の理想の体型に\n少しでも近付きたいし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怠けた生活をすると\nその代償は必ず自分に\n帰ってくるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々のほんの少しの意識"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を持つようにしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ過ぎた日は階段を使う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意識して野菜を取る"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"週1くらいの半身浴"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく歩く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段の生活で取り入れられる\nような物を中心に\nゆるーくやってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエットの方法って\n世の中にたくさんありますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合う合わないがあると\n思うので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にあった方法を\n見つけるのが\n理想の体型になるための\n近道かなって(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美は1日にしてならず"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とよく聞くので、\n毎日の小さな積み重ねを\n続けていきたいです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな事言ってますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にいるメンバーは本当\nお手本になるような\n綺麗で可愛い子ばかりなので\n私もまだまだ頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に綺麗になりましょ(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも\nオススメの美容情報とか\nあったら教えて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また\n長くなってしまったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこの辺で終わりにします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ質問募集してますので\n気軽に質問して下さいね！\n待ってます(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週は遂にお見立て会！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3ヶ月前から考えていた\nサインを初めて披露するので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当選した方は何に書いて貰うか\n考えておいて下さいね(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館ライブも\n今日から予約受付スタート！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もまだどんなステージに\nなるかわからないのですが、\n今から凄く楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月は握手会もあるし、\n皆さんにたくさん会えるので\n今は寂しいですが、\nあとひと踏ん張り我慢です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また\n皆さんのいつもと変わらぬ笑顔が\n見られる事を楽しみに\n私も準備しておきますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日は\n拳銃まいちゅんでお別れです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0026.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(バレッタのMVごっこの巻)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また2週間後まで\n忘れずに待ってて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/11/09/0513596/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新内眞衣"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-45874":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"      喫茶店の困るところと言えば店員さんを呼ぶボタンがない事。喫茶店大好きだからよく行くけど毎回自分の心と大戦争を繰り広げています  人見知りのあまり、遠くにいる店員さんに声をかける事が出来ない、、近付いてきた！よし、声かけよう！と思ったら緊張のあまり声が出ない、、渡辺はモンブランが食べたい。モンブランを一つ頼むただそれだけ「すみませーん」と言えばいいだけ。 よし、目で圧をかける作戦に出よう。いや緊張して目も合わせられないんだった！！  あ、隣の席の人に食事を運んできた！よし今度こそ！！ 「あ...あの...すみまん...」 \"すみまん\"って何いいいいいい！？何故\"せ\"が抜けた！？！？何故\"すみません\"の5文字が言えないんだ渡辺！！  でも優しい店員さんは気付いてくれてモンブランを頼む事が出来ました、、 はああああ、こういうところを直したいです。笑   "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF6BT8AF9HGCJNP257GD8TA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">   ついに始まります。真夏の全国ツアー2018明治神宮野球場、秩父宮ラグビー場2会場同時開催です。  私達もまだどうなるか想像が出来ていません。でもきっと、楽しんでいただけるはず！   黄色と緑(もしくは黄緑)のサイリウム、タオル、うちわしっかり見てます！ 宜しくお願いします(*´-`)   "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF6BVBRC3M41CMBP6PWCN2G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">  天気がなかなか優れず不安定ですがお越し下さる皆様お気を付けてお越し下さい！ ポニーテールして弾けてるので余裕のある方はぜひ見つけて下さい(^ ^)   みり愛 "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-26036":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n 高校1年生の濱岸ひよりです！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ2EC3S75KCMRMAVRGAV1GJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ2ED5Y0ZX1N7SQJ5ZX4GFB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n Flashスペシャルさんに\n 松田好花\n 宮田愛萌\n 濱岸ひより\n で、登場します！！\n \n 水を木にかけたり暑かったけどすごく楽しかったです！\n ぜひゲットしてくださいね〜\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ2EE5T4N8PSXH59PVCFS98","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ねこの大きいクッキーー！！！\n めっちゃ可愛い😍\n \n ママが買ってきてくれたっちゃん🐥🐥\n \n でもこんな可愛いのあるとどこから食べたらいいのかわからん、\n \n \n \n \n \n \n ばいころまる〜"}],"source":"archive"}}